{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story Synopsis\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once, there was a delinquent girl boss \u2014 Maren \u2014 who ruled her turf with an iron fist.<br>Through sheer strength and charisma, she brought countless delinquents under her command, standing proudly at the very peak of her domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, her beloved boyfriend \u2014 Ren \u2014 suddenly decided to move to another town.<br>\u201cI just want to stay by Ren\u2019s side.\u201d With that single heartfelt wish, Maren resolved to follow him without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the new town was also a world ruled by \u201cbancho.\u201d<br>Sitting at its top was a cunning, cold-hearted mastermind \u2014 one who wore a smile on the surface, but wielded ruthless schemes behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fists alone would no longer be enough \u2014<br>A battle of strategy and domination was about to begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Maren conquer this unfamiliar land,<br>and protect her peaceful days together with Ren?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Character Introduction\u3011 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/59504cb927ac11144ed7a292f3d12732.avif?t=1769154097\" width=200 height=450 /></span>Homura Maren</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful delinquent girl boss.<br>Once, with nothing but her own strength, she forced an entire region of delinquents to submit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After meeting Ren Asagiri,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she came to realize that behind all that strength,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there was in fact a heart longing for gentle love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/92786180b6d1d1e98b953b965aad7b1a.avif?t=1769154097\" width=200 height=450 /></span><strong>Ren Asagiri</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Maren was expanding her influence,<br>I was once saved by her from the bullying of a delinquent gang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I want Maren to break free from that dangerous world.<br>No matter what,<br>I want to become someone who will be useful to my future self.<br>And one day, I want to be someone who can protect Maren.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/00e0b2e56ff98fb508db8828e872e282.avif?t=1769154097\" width=200 height=450 /></span><strong>S\u014dga K\u014d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bancho of a neighboring town.<br>Possesses immense strength, but an even sharper mind.<br>Holds exceptional skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in the end, he is nothing more than a vile and despicable man.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game System\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain maps use a simplified ARPG mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/369a1f6a582949d78158c764f7a6241d.poster.avif?t=1769154097\" width=1170 height=618 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/369a1f6a582949d78158c764f7a6241d.webm?t=1769154097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/369a1f6a582949d78158c764f7a6241d.mp4?t=1769154097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015350/extras/7c1de0d9897c065617e84af7e79d61a4.poster.avif?t=1769